@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@playerId = 0192f28f-5dc0-7d58-bdb2-814ad6a0f4a1
@zeroBalancePlayerId = 0192f28f-5dc0-7d58-bdb2-814ad6a0f4a2

### ============================================================================
### 1. Criar Wallet com Saldo Inicial > 0 (201 Created)
###    Gera transação interna OPENING + lançamento CREDIT no ledger na mesma TX
### ============================================================================
# @name createWallet
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: corr-wallet-open-001

{
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "initialBalance": {
    "amount": "1000.00",
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}

### Captura automática do walletId retornado acima
@walletId = {{createWallet.response.body.id}}

### ============================================================================
### 2. Criar Wallet Duplicada para o mesmo playerId + currency (409 Conflict)
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: corr-wallet-dup-002

{
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "initialBalance": {
    "amount": "500.00",
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}

### ============================================================================
### 3. Criar Wallet com Saldo Inicial 0.00 (201 Created — sem lançamento OPENING)
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: corr-wallet-zero-003

{
  "playerId": "{{zeroBalancePlayerId}}",
  "initialBalance": {
    "amount": "0.00",
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}

### ============================================================================
### 4. Validação de Money Inválido — Escala incorreta / negativo (400 Bad Request)
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: corr-wallet-invalid-004

{
  "playerId": "0192f28f-5dc0-7d58-bdb2-999999999999",
  "initialBalance": {
    "amount": "-10.5",
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}

### ============================================================================
### 5. Consultar Wallet por ID (200 OK)
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}
X-Correlation-Id: corr-wallet-get-005

### ============================================================================
### 6. Listar Lançamentos do Ledger com Paginação por Cursor Opaco (200 OK)
### ============================================================================
# @name listLedgerPage1
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/ledger?limit=50
X-Correlation-Id: corr-wallet-ledger-006

### ============================================================================
### 7. Executar Reconciliação da Wallet (200 OK — consistent: true)
###    Comprova que wallet.balance == saldo reconstruído pelo ledger
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/reconciliation
X-Correlation-Id: corr-wallet-reconcile-007

